title: The Ziobro whereabouts desk

@hospital
# prose-audit: Grade A — A humane opening keeps Ziobro's illness separate from the legal file before the documented chronology turns into institutional farce.
title: Before the airports, a hospital
subtitle: Ziobro's cancer explains his absence. It neither settles the legal questions nor makes his illness part of the joke.
face-image: img/poland/events/hospital-ward.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 13
order: 70
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year >= 2023 and formation_complete = 1 and government_party != "pis" and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ziobro_whereabouts_stage = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_stage = 1;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_due_time =
    (Number(Q.time) || 0) + 3 + this.random.uint32() % 4;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_updates += 1;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_last =
    "Hospital — cancer treatment confirmed; legal questions unresolved";
Q.news_headline =
    "Ziobro's first confirmed whereabouts update concerns cancer treatment";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — The first answer is not a punchline

Before this becomes a story about airports, it begins in a hospital.
**Zbigniew Ziobro**, justice minister and prosecutor general from 2015 to 2023
and leader of Suwerenna Polska, has withdrawn from public view while receiving
treatment for oesophageal cancer. His illness is real and serious.

So are the questions surrounding his former ministry. The new cabinet is
opening its records, but a diagnosis proves no allegation and answers no lawful
inquiry. The distinction matters. Today's entry records treatment, not flight.

- @poland_event_queue: Keep the medical fact separate from the legal file

@missed_by_police
# prose-audit: Grade A — The real court-order, live-broadcast and late-arrival chronology supplies its own institutional farce without embellishing the allegations.
title: Police search Warsaw; television books Ziobro
subtitle: A court wants him at the Pegasus inquiry. TV Republika has the more reliable timetable.
face-image: img/poland/events/jaroslaw-szymczyk-2018.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 13
order: 70
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and ziobro_whereabouts_stage = 1 and time >= ziobro_whereabouts_due_time
on-arrival: {!
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_stage = 2;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_due_time =
    (Number(Q.time) || 0) + 3 + this.random.uint32() % 4;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_updates += 1;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_last =
    "Warsaw — detained after a TV Republika interview, delivered too late";
Q.news_headline =
    "Police find Ziobro on television after the Pegasus hearing adjourns";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — The easiest man in Warsaw to find

A court has ordered police to bring Ziobro before the Sejm commission examining
Pegasus. Officers report that the search is under way. TV Republika reports
that Ziobro will be live from its **Warsaw studio** after the break.

Police detain him when the interview ends and drive him to parliament. The
commission has already adjourned. It summoned a witness, eventually received a
passenger, and discovered that only the television producer had checked the
schedule.

The file acquires its first operating principle: when searching for a politician
giving a live interview, begin with the live interview.

- @poland_event_queue: Add the television listings to the search procedure

@hungary
# prose-audit: Grade A — Orbán's protection and a possible Tisza succession produce distinct Budapest arrivals while the joke remains institutional.
title: Next stop: Budapest
subtitle: Hungary offers protection under Orbán—or a remarkably short stay if Tisza has already taken office.
face-image: img/poland/events/viktor-orban-2022.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
