view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and ziobro_whereabouts_stage = 2 and time >= ziobro_whereabouts_due_time
on-arrival: {!
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_stage = 3;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_due_time =
    (Number(Q.time) || 0) + 3 + this.random.uint32() % 4;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_updates += 1;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_last = Q.hungary_fidesz_in_power
    ? "Budapest — protected by Viktor Orbán's government"
    : "Budapest — a very short stay under Péter Magyar's government";
Q.news_headline = Q.hungary_fidesz_in_power
    ? "Ziobro reappears in Budapest with Orbán's protection"
    : "Ziobro arrives in Budapest after its welcome mat disappears";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Budapest, with or without a welcome mat

Reports now place Ziobro in **Hungary**. Polish prosecutors prepare the next
document. Polish television prepares six guests and an animated flight path.

[? if hungary_fidesz_in_power: Viktor Orbán's government treats the former PiS
minister as a victim of political persecution and grants him protection. The
legal request reaches a friendly government, where it develops a sudden and
apparently incurable lack of urgency.?]
[? if not hungary_fidesz_in_power: Péter Magyar's new government has promised
to cooperate with Warsaw. Ziobro has crossed a border in search of political
protection and discovered that the government changed while he was in the
departures lounge.?]

The official entry reads **Budapest**. Every newsroom supplies its own style of
question mark.

- @poland_event_queue: Write down Budapest—provisionally

