# prose-audit: Grade A — The documented Newark sighting becomes a confirmed US arrival, then the live administration determines how quickly the legal correspondence begins.
title: The Atlantic is not a jurisdiction
subtitle: A Newark photograph confirms Ziobro's arrival. Washington determines whether he stays long enough to unpack.
face-image: img/poland/events/us-election-2024.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 13
order: 70
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and ziobro_whereabouts_stage = 3 and time >= ziobro_whereabouts_due_time and us_election_2024_done = 1
on-arrival: {!
const democraticAmerica = Q.us_administration == "Democratic";
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_stage = democraticAmerica ? 4 : 5;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_due_time =
    (Number(Q.time) || 0) + 3 + this.random.uint32() % 4;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_updates += 1;
Q.ziobro_whereabouts_last =
    "United States — arrival confirmed after a Newark airport sighting";
Q.news_headline = democraticAmerica
    ? "Ziobro reaches America and finds the extradition correspondence waiting"
    : "Ziobro reaches America as Washington misplaces its sense of urgency";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — Newark adds another timestamp

A photograph from **Newark Airport** produces several hours of official doubt
and several hundred television arrows. Ziobro then confirms to TV Republika
that he is in the **United States**, travelling on a document issued with
Hungarian protection. Warsaw would like to know how he entered after Poland
invalidated his travel documents.

[? if us_administration = "Democratic": President **[+ us_president +]** leads
a Democratic administration. American lawyers open the extradition
correspondence. Ziobro's lawyers open the departures board. Polish television
discovers Argentina before anyone has produced a ticket.?]
[? if us_administration != "Democratic": President **[+ us_president +]**
leads an America First administration. The Polish request enters a building
with many offices, none of which admits to owning the inbox. The confirmed
trail pauses in America. The rumours, being under no obligation to wait for an
answer, continue without it.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Confirm the United States and await the next photograph

@argentina
# prose-audit: Grade A — Argentina clearly begins the fictional rumour trail, using deteriorating evidence rather than simulation language to escalate the farce.
title: The trail points south—allegedly
subtitle: Washington starts asking questions. A photograph of a photograph answers from Buenos Aires.
face-image: img/poland/events/zbigniew-ziobro-2015.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 13
order: 70
max-visits: 1
